  "question": {
    "text": "Two concentric coils each of radius equal to $2 \\pi \\mathrm{cm}$ are placed at right angles to each other. 3 Ampere and 4 ampere are the currents flowing in each coil respectively. The magnetic induction in Weber $/ \\mathrm{m}^2$ at the centre of the coils will be $\\left(\\mu_0=4 \\pi \\times 10^{-7}\\right.$ Wb/A-m)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
